{"strongs": "H1537", "word": "גִּלְגָּל", "translit": "gil.gal", "root": "גלל", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "circle", "definition": "II. גִּלְגָּל proper name, of a location (= (sacred) circle of stones; compare Di on Josh 5:9 , where word-play on roll away, off) — with article except Josh 5:9 ; Josh 12:23 — 1. place east of Jericho, where Israel lay encamped Josh 4:19 ; Josh 4:20 ; Josh 5:9 ; Josh 5:10 ; Josh 9:6 ; Josh 10:7 ; Josh 10:9 ; Josh 14:6 compare also Mic 6:5 & Judg 3:19 הַפְּסִילִים ׳ אֲשֶׁר אֶתהַֿגּ ;? modern Tell Jeljul Bd Pal 169 ; perhaps also the place where sacrifices were offered 1Sam 10:8 ; 1Sam 11:14 ; 1Sam 11:15 (twice in verse); 1Sam 13:4 ; 1Sam 13:7 ; 1Sam 13:8 ; 1Sam 13:12 ; 1Sam 13:15 (in v 1Sam 13:15 insert also with other words, Dr compare We ) 1Sam 15:12 ; 1Sam 15:21 ; 1Sam 15:33 place of illicit sacrifice Hos 4:15 ; Hos 9:15 ; Hos 12:12 ; Amos 4:4 ; Amos 5:5 (twice in verse), named also Judg 2:1 ; 1Sam 7:16 ; 2Sam 19:16 ; 2Sam 19:41 ? = בֵּית הַגִּלְגָּל Neh 12:29 . 2. place on border between Judah & Benjamin Josh 15:17 (= גְּלִילוֺת Josh 18:17 compare Di ). 3. place in Northern Israel, dwelling of prophets 2Kgs 2:1 ; 2Kgs 4:38 , modern Jiljilie south from Nâbulus, southwest from Seilûn (Shiloh) compare Di Ri HWB 518. 4. place in Northern Israel near Mt. Gerizim and Mt. Ebal Deut 11:30 , identification with 3 by Ke Ri HWB 518 Schenkel BL SS ; but compare Di . 5. in phrase מֶלֶךְ גּוֺיִם לְגִּלְגָּל Josh 12:23 , in list of Canaanitish kings; probably name of a (northern) district compare Di ( B βασιλέα Γεεὶ τῆς Γαλιλαίας — but ᵐ5 L & Manuscripts Γοειμ τῆς Γελγελ ); Di compare Isa 8:23 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1662')\">BDB1662</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1537')\">H1537</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1661')\">BDB1661</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1663')\">BDB1663</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>גִּלְגָּל</bdbheb> <